# graphify working state: ignore everything by default and keep only the three
# artifacts that are worth reading. The AST cache and dotfiles are regenerated by
# `graphify update .` and have no business in a plugin repo.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/graph.html
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md

# template backups written by the daemon
templates.json.bak
